            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BRT"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Changed the recipe slightly, used full cream milk instead of cream but stuck with the rest of the recipe. Used Teelings Irish whisky and ground Cuban coffee \nGood long slow blend and this was great after being chilled for about 4 hours, liked it better than Baileys !",
