            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "El Oscuro"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Instead of using instant coffee, I just added a cup of extra strong brewed coffee. I also used light cream instead of heavy cream, and omitted the almond extract as my wife doesn't like it, I also didn't blend it - I just mixed everything together in a pitcher before pouring it into the leftover Baileys Cream bottle.",
            "datePublished": "2016-06-13T02:12:41.680Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Teresa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Awesome recipe. It is always in our fridge during cabin season. I half the almond extract. I have also made it with spiced rum instead of whiskey which was excellent. Try adding a cinnamon stick to the bottle for another twist.",
            "datePublished": "2016-07-13T17:50:04.653Z"
          },
          {
